{"ID":"20240506102404-x3j66xd","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506102404-x3j66xd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102404-x3j66xd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102404-cbju8q1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613112254-40vsz7e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2227,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613112252-if5vpjr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"303蔺茹（茹、䕡茹）","type":"doc","updated":"20240826092536"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240826092449-awwtjmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826092449-awwtjmo","updated":"20240826092449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 520px;","style":"width: 510px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蔺茹"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蔺茹-20240826092449-et4hw9e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 510px;\" parent-style=\"width: 520px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826092536-ejj7qa2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826092536-ejj7qa2","updated":"20240826092536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 520px;","style":"width: 510px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蔺茹 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蔺茹 1-20240826092536-va1yv89.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 510px;\" parent-style=\"width: 520px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240701160824-ld5yuwf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240701160824-ld5yuwf","updated":"20240701160824"}},{"ID":"20240701160824-1p7u922","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240701160824-1p7u922","updated":"20240701160824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兰茹《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240701160824-8pjnw3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160824-8pjnw3i","updated":"20240701160824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（《御览》作闾，是）"}]},{"ID":"20240701160824-21ejy0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160824-21ejy0f","updated":"20240701160824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240701160824-6lrtp0e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160824-6lrtp0e","updated":"20240701160824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主蚀恶肉，败创，死肌，杀疥虫，排脓恶血，除大风热气，善忘不乐。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240701160824-bqbwhoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160824-bqbwhoj","updated":"20240701160824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：闾茹一名离楼，一名屈居，神农辛，岐伯酸咸有毒，李氏大寒，二月采，叶员黄，高四五尺，叶四四相当，四月华黄，五月实黑，根黄有汁，亦同黄，三月五月采根，黑头者良（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240701160824-h4dnpv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160824-h4dnpv6","updated":"20240701160824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名屈据，一名离娄，生代郡，五月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240701160824-gcua55x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160824-gcua55x","updated":"20240701160824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：屈居，芦茹也。《范子计然》云：闾茹出武都，黄色者善。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112009-de7fjcx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613112009-de7fjcx"}},{"ID":"20240613112011-io3tfhq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613112011-io3tfhq","updated":"20240613112015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240613112011-739esvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112011-739esvc","updated":"20240613112011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、酸、寒、微寒，有小毒。主蚀恶肉，败疮，死肌，杀疥虫，排脓恶血，除大风热气，善忘，不乐。去热痹，破症瘕，除息肉。一名屈据，一名离娄。生代郡川谷。五月采根，阴干。黑头者良。（甘草为之使，恶麦门冬。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613112011-d54963e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112011-d54963e","updated":"20240613112011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今第一出高丽，色黄。初断时汁出凝黑如漆，故云漆头。次出近道，名草 茹，色白，皆烧铁烁头令黑，以当漆头，非真也。叶似大戟，花黄，二月便生。根亦治疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112033-7q2s9ix","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613112033-7q2s9ix"}},{"ID":"20240613112034-aq2eind","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613112034-aq2eind","updated":"20240613112038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240613112034-k7yx068","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112034-k7yx068","updated":"20240613112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泻，破血"}]},{"ID":"20240613112034-pdhk9fu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112034-pdhk9fu","updated":"20240613112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛寒，有小毒。蚀恶肉，排脓血，杀疥虫，除热痹，破症瘕（《内经》同乌贼骨。治妇人血枯）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112034-5ji559s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112034-5ji559s","updated":"20240613112034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根如莱菔，皮黄肉白，叶长微阔，折之有汁，结实如豆，一颗三粒。甘草为使。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112105-zyh3ezd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613112105-zyh3ezd"}},{"ID":"20240613111934-604ttyn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613111934-604ttyn","updated":"20240613111938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240613111934-n2e6m9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613111934-n2e6m9m","updated":"20240613111934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹治疥，马疥尤善。服食方用者至少。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112113-ag8le3r","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613112113-ag8le3r","updated":"20240613112113"}},{"ID":"20240613112155-mjhrosw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613112155-mjhrosw","updated":"20240613112200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240613112155-g93ah20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112155-g93ah20","updated":"20240613112155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒．有小毒．入足厥阴经．功专蚀恶肉．排脓血．杀疥虫．除热痹．破症瘕．内经云．同乌 鱼骨治妇人血枯．甘草为使．"}]},{"ID":"20240613112155-i5w1ppw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613112155-i5w1ppw"}},{"ID":"20240613112204-qsempqz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613112204-qsempqz","updated":"20240613112213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613112204-c3oesxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112204-c3oesxy","updated":"20240613112209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹，生代郡川谷，今河阳、淄、齐州亦有之。二月生苗，叶似大戟而花黄色；根如萝卜，皮赤黄，肉白，初断时，汁出凝黑如漆；三月开浅红花，亦淡黄色，不着子。陶隐居谓出高丽者，此近之也。四月、五月采根，阴干。漆头者良。又有一种草 茹，色白。采者烧铁烁头，令黑，以当漆头，非真也。然古方有用两种者。姚僧垣治痈疽生臭恶肉，以白 茹散傅之，看肉尽便停，但傅诸膏药。若不生肉，又傅黄 散。恶肉仍不尽者，可以漆头赤皮 茹为散，用半钱匕，和白 茹散三钱匕，合傅之，瘥。是赤、白皆可用也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112205-vcj9e99","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613112205-vcj9e99"}},{"ID":"20240613112218-pcjcvu4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613112218-pcjcvu4","updated":"20240613112224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613112218-tbtsoah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112218-tbtsoah","updated":"20240613112218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛寒，有小毒。折之汁出凝黑如漆，故名漆头。 茹色白者名草 茹。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112218-dg0rece","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112218-dg0rece","updated":"20240613112218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主疽蚀恶肉，败疮死肌，杀疥虫，排脓恶血，除大风热气，善忘不寐。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112218-3ib38hc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112218-3ib38hc","updated":"20240613112218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹《本经》治恶肉败疮等病，而《素问》四乌 一 茹丸，当非此 茹可知也。《圣惠》治头风旋眩，《千金》治小儿痈疽，并用漆头 茹，姚僧坦治痈疽去恶血有白茹丸，二者皆取能散血。其治善忘不寐，亦是因风热侵犯心包、胆腑所致，散其风热，则无不寐善忘之患矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112219-b53h87d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613112219-b53h87d"}},{"ID":"20240613112228-xgixviw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613112228-xgixviw","updated":"20240613112232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240613112228-9cuuwpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112228-9cuuwpk","updated":"20240613112228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、辛，寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112228-xen0qjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112228-xen0qjq","updated":"20240613112228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹，其黑如漆，故又云漆头。去恶血，治痈疽，作散频敷，肉满便止，破症瘕，杀疥虫，逐败疮死肌，除大风热气。又草 其根色白，主治相同。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112228-xudy5sc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613112228-xudy5sc"}},{"ID":"20240613112241-l0l5w4d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613112241-l0l5w4d","updated":"20240613112247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240613112241-o8n0eqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112241-o8n0eqs","updated":"20240613112241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"泻、破血．"}]},{"ID":"20240613112241-y1yf5hp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112241-y1yf5hp","updated":"20240613112241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛寒．蚀恶肉．排脓血．杀疥虫．除热痹．破症瘕．（素问、同乌 骨、治妇人血枯．）"}]},{"ID":"20240613112241-b14w7z5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112241-b14w7z5","updated":"20240613112241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根如莱菔．皮黄肉白．叶长微阔．折之有汁．结实如豆．一颗三粒．甘草为使．"}]},{"ID":"20240613112242-38dzlrk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613112242-38dzlrk"}},{"ID":"20240613112252-xphiy14","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613112252-xphiy14","updated":"20240613112259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613112252-if5vpjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112252-if5vpjr","updated":"20240613112310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白者名草 䕡茹"}]},{"ID":"20240613112252-wvoxiqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112252-wvoxiqh","updated":"20240613112252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘草为之使。恶麦门冬。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112252-k3olpk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613112252-k3olpk3","updated":"20240613112252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，寒，有小毒。排脓杀虫。破症瘕，除热痹，去死肌，退风热。配海螵蛸丸服，治妇人血枯，（血瘀而枯。）配苦酒、猪脂，涂甲疽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613112253-0vuhcmm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613112253-0vuhcmm"}},{"ID":"20240701160809-2qudp0h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240701160809-2qudp0h","updated":"20240701160809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蔺茹《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240701160809-on9amwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160809-on9amwu","updated":"20240701160809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"散瘀积之稽留，乌䕡茹，经方有法，达肝家之脉络，辛咸寒毒，风癞兼宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240701160809-4q0hq6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160809-4q0hq6q","updated":"20240701160809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（蔺茹即茹，其根皮黄色，肉带黑色，折之有汁出，辛咸寒毒，入肝经，宣通脉络中瘀血，血行风自灭，故本经又称其能治大风，又能杀疥虫，排脓血，蚀恶肉，除症瘕，然寒毒之品，亦非可常用之物也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240701160809-57oxdf7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240701160809-57oxdf7","updated":"20240701160809"}},{"ID":"20240701160809-e1qdwrd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240701160809-e1qdwrd","updated":"20240701160809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"䕡茹《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240701160809-nqtu06k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160809-nqtu06k","updated":"20240701160809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，微寒，有小毒。去热痹，破症瘕，除息肉。一名屈据，一名离娄。生代郡。五月采根，阴干。黑头者良。（甘草为之使，恶麦门冬。）"}]},{"ID":"20240701160809-ysvqkix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160809-ysvqkix","updated":"20240701160809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文：䕡茹，味辛，寒。主蚀恶肉败疮死肌，杀疥虫，排脓恶血，除大风热气，善忘不乐。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240701160810-7er77o3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240701160810-7er77o3"}},{"ID":"20240701160811-vfwuo4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240701160811-vfwuo4t"}}]}